## Data attribution

This project uses publicly available data from:
- 환경부 온실가스종합정보센터 (GIR) — data.go.kr (KOGL 1형)
- 금융감독원 DART Open API — opendart.fss.or.kr
- 국토교통부 VWorld Geocoder — vworld.kr
- 기상청 ASOS — data.kma.go.kr
- ESA Copernicus Sentinel-5P — Google Earth Engine
- NASA ECMWF ERA5 — Google Earth Engine
- NIES ODIAC v2024 — db.cger.nies.go.jp/dataset/ODIAC
- KCGS (한국ESG기준원) — cgs.or.kr (publicly disclosed press releases)
- KRX (한국거래소) — krx.co.kr
- 23 publicly listed Korean companies' Sustainability Reports
  (downloaded from each company's IR website per their public availability)

Each data source retains its own license; redistribution is governed by
individual terms. This MIT License covers ONLY the source code in this
repository, not the data files (which are in .gitignore).
